## Conclusion
This project demonstrates the application of **K-Nearest Neighbors** on a real-world dataset with **categorical and discrete features**. By encoding categorical variables and evaluating the classifier using accuracy and confusion matrix, we can reliably predict the overall car evaluation. This workflow is an example of applying **machine learning to practical, structured datasets**.

